      "about": "Animate a still image using the Happy Horse 1.1 image-to-video model\n(``happyhorse-1.1-i2v``).\n\nThe provided ``image_url`` is used as the first frame. Image must be\nat least 300px in width and height, with an aspect ratio between\n1:2.5 and 2.5:1, up to 20 MB (JPEG, JPG, PNG, BMP, or WEBP)."
